<Introduction>
<Description>
<DisplayWhen>StartDescriptionWithThis</DisplayWhen>
<Text>Manual map stress test for ADRIFT-5-XML.md section 6.15. Type HELP. REVEAL marks Main-page rooms seen. After REVEAL: Cellar-East dotted (started blocked), Wide-South solid (started passable). OPEN/CLOSE DOOR and OPEN/CLOSE LATCH flip those links; OPEN/CLOSE GATE flips off-page stubs.</Text>
</Description>
