<LongDescription>
<Description>
<DisplayWhen>StartDescriptionWithThis</DisplayWhen>
<Text>Map focus. After REVEAL expect:
- solid duplex N to North (bent midpoints)
- one-way arrow E to Skewed (East-&gt;North anchors, room drawn SE)
- solid S and Down lines to Cellar (same dest)
- solid W to No Link (Hub has West Movement but no Map Link; No Link's East Map Link still draws the connector)
- Up line to dim Attic (Z=1)
- green IN to Closet
- pink OUT stub toward unseen Outside
- SE one-way to Disagree (drawn NW)
- NE/SW/NW stubs toward unseen Annex rooms (NW only while Gate=1; SW only while Gate=0)</Text>
</Description>
</LongDescription>
